     "link": "https://mempool.space/address/bc1qzfhq63mqkkm8efgav0t209e6tmxm9u5c26neul"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "date": "2026-09-17",
   "kind": "public",
   "chapter": "theft",
   "text": "The attacker opens an ordinary Blink account.",
   "source_url": "https://www.blink.sv/blog/sept-19-attack-postmortem-and-bounty",
   "source_label": "Source: Blink post-mortem",
   "indicators": []
  },
  {
   "date": "2026-09-18",
   "kind": "onchain",
   "chapter": "ecash",
   "text": "The day before the attack, a coin from his 10 September split is spent together with the wallet that funded aegis-ln — one owner.",
   "source_url": null,
   "source_label": "Source: Blink post-mortem",
   "indicators": [
    {
     "id": "E-X3",
     "type": "tx",
     "value": "485c61e857ccefeec4d5350f8ffc8618a7cf34f8899f34d1febf14ab3b7dacbb",
     "link": "https://mempool.space/tx/485c61e857ccefeec4d5350f8ffc8618a7cf34f8899f34d1febf14ab3b7dacbb"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "date": "2026-09-19",
   "kind": "public",
   "chapter": "theft",
   "text": "Using a flaw in how Blink's admin tools checked permissions, the attacker takes over 35 accounts and withdraws from 24 of them between 09:51 and 11:54 UTC — 6.61085425 BTC in total: 4.62685758 BTC on-chain to eight addresses in 12 transactions, the rest over Lightning. Blink switches the custodial service off at about 11:54 UTC.",
   "source_url": "https://www.blink.sv/blog/sept-19-attack-postmortem-and-bounty",
   "source_label": "Source: Blink post-mortem",
   "indicators": [
