  {
   "date": "2026-09-20",
   "kind": "onchain",
   "chapter": "trail",
   "text": "In one block he combines the stolen coins at three of the eight addresses with coins from three other addresses of his, and splits the result into new addresses. Five of the eight receiving addresses are left untouched.",
   "source_url": null,
   "source_label": "Source: Blink post-mortem",
   "indicators": [
