   "kind": "onchain",
   "chapter": "trail",
   "text": "From 12:24 UTC he splits the other coin of about 690,000,000 sats he held before the attack and pays all of it into the swap service in seven chunks — six of 100,000,000 sats and a last one of 90,684,350.",
