   "kind": "onchain",
   "chapter": "live",
   "text": "15:07 UTC: he combines the coins at his collection address and six other addresses — including the three small deposits others had sent to his first theft address — into four new outputs: three he most likely kept (95,890,762, 30,000,000 and 12,928,452 sats) and one round 30,000,000-sat output whose destination is not yet established. Spending those deposits together with his coins proves that every address in this transaction is his.",
